# Screenshots, read by tools/screenshots.sh (locally and in the docs workflow).
# Every image is taken light and dark: <name>.png and <name>-dark.png.
#
# name      example file from docs/examples, without .etiketto
# state     ETIKETTO_SCREENSHOT_STATE: - (main window), expand, styles (expand
#           with the box and frame options open), print
# targets   readme      README and Flathub, English: docs/screenshots/
#           readme:LL   README in language LL: docs/screenshots/
#           docs        user documentation, every documentation language:
#                       site/build/screenshots/<lang>/ (not committed)
#
# name      example   state    targets
main        spice     -        readme docs
expand      spice     expand   readme docs
print       spice     print    readme docs
colour      party     -        readme
sticker     sticker   -        readme
cable-de    cable     -        readme:de
die-cut     shelf     -        readme docs
serial      serial    expand   readme docs
design      design    styles   readme docs
